    "changedBehavior": "Only a paused diagnostic PNG job already in flight prevents a further scene/reflection/composer submission; the next requestAnimationFrame, lastTime update, DOM cancellation and original 20000 ms deadline remain. Program capture adds phase timestamps, its own success/aborted draw report and separately labels the earlier ordinary-frame partial audit.",
